+# PBL-08-T3 — Implementación
+
+- `MetOperationalPanel.jsx`: KPIs + decisiones + detalle técnico
+- `SparkAnalysisScreen.jsx`: rama `type === 'met'`
+- `SparkDataViews.jsx`: DataObject/DataValue compartidos
+- i18n `spark.met.*` ES/EN
+- `IMPLEMENTED_TYPES = ('clinical', 'met')`
+- Test `pbl08-met.test.js`
